{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02400","headline":"咏汉高祖 · 王珪","name":"咏汉高祖","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汉祖起丰沛，乘运以跃鳞。\n手奋三尺劒，西灭无道秦。\n十月五星聚，七年四海宾。\n高抗威宇宙，贵有天下人。\n忆昔与项王，契阔时未伸。\n鸿门既薄蚀，荥阳亦蒙尘。\n虮虱生介胄，将卒多苦辛。\n爪牙驱信越，腹心谋张陈。\n赫赫西楚国，化爲丘与榛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王珪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02400.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02400","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}